  keyed rows, components, context, error boundaries, mount)
- `crates/nlayer-js/src/protocol.rs` from `crates/nsh-js/src/protocol.rs`
  (styles with a static transform list, the v1 host props; animation,
  shadows, filters and native components are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-js/src/modules.rs` extends the loader table with
  `nlayer:rt` and the host components as values
- `crates/nlayer-bundler/src/jsx.rs` from `crates/nsh-bundler/src/jsx.rs`
