  `import.meta.url`, native components and UI sets are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-bundler/src/compile.rs` from
  `crates/nsh-bundler/src/compile.rs` (one module: TypeScript removal,
  named import checks against the native modules, and that module's source
  map; rolldown, hot reload and props checks are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-bundler/src/bundle.rs` from `crates/nsh-bundler/src/bundle.rs`
  (one entry chunk and its source map; no code splitting, no themes,
  capabilities, hot reload or native-use report)
- `crates/nlayer-bundler/src/plugin.rs` from `crates/nsh-bundler/src/plugin.rs`
  (resolve, load and transform: native modules external, app modules
  compiled, PNG / JPEG / WebP imports with density variants; fonts, SVG
  and split handling are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-core/src/typescript.rs` from `crates/nsh-core/src/js/style.rs`
  (style interfaces from the style table, cut to the v1 keys; animated
  values, shadows, gradients and filters are not emitted)
- `crates/nlayer-bundler/src/types.rs` (the module and asset declarations
  `build` writes; not the nsh element-registry generator)
- `crates/nlayer-js/src/net.rs` from `crates/nsh-core/src/platform.rs`
  (`HttpRequest` / `HttpHead`, cut to whole bodies and no streams)
- `crates/nlayer-engine/src/net.rs` from `crates/nsh-engine/src/net.rs`
  (ureq with rustls, whole bodies; streaming, pause and cancellation are
  not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-platform-web/src/encode.rs` from
  `crates/nsh-platform-web/src/encode.rs` and `src/text/css.rs` (the mount
  JSON and its CSS classes, cut to the v1 views and the whitelist: fill,
  radius, opacity, overflow, static transform, transform origin, border
  and attributed text spans; shadows, gradients, filters and glyph runs
  are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-platform-web/web/nlayer.js` and `web/base.css` from
  `crates/nsh-platform-web/web/nsh.js` (the DOM mounter, the same cut:
  frames, classes, border overlay, scroll spacer, single-line field)
- `URL` / `URLSearchParams` behavior from `crates/nsh-js/src/web/url.rs`
  (bound on this host's classes; nsh's web class layer is not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-js/src/random.rs` from `crates/nsh-js/src/standard/random.rs`
  (the wasm custom getrandom hook; the page fills `__nlayer_random_fill`)
- `LocalEngine` in `crates/nlayer-engine/src/lib.rs` from `nsh_engine::LocalEngine`
  (the caller's thread pumps input, timers and finished fetches; component
  tasks, display frames and posted JS calls are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-platform-web/src/page.rs`, `src/ffi.rs`, `web/boot.js` and
  `web/index.html` from `nsh-platform-web/src/lib.rs` and `web/nsh.js` (the
  page's engine: one wasm module, mount JSON into the DOM mounter, the
  browser's `fetch`, press, input, scroll, resize, safe area and the
  keyboard inset. Text measurement is the headless stand-in. Glyph runs,
  hot reload and bytecode are not copied)
- `crates/nlayer-engine` feature `browser` and the wasm target of
  `crates/nlayer-platform-web` (`src/browser/`, `web/browser/`) follow
  `nsh-platform-web`'s browser host: the page evaluates the app and that
  wasm module does not link QuickJS. The opcode facade is written for nlayer's v1
  modules; nsh's canvas, list, gesture and animation facades are not copied.
- `crates/nlayer-platform-ios` from `crates/nsh-platform-ios`
  (`app.rs`, `surface.rs`, `mount.rs`, `text.rs`, `text_view.rs`,
  `decor.rs`, `image.rs`, `input.rs`): one window, frames, fill, radius,
  opacity, overflow, a static transform, solid and dashed borders, `onPress`,
  `activeStyle` / `hoverStyle` / `focusStyle`, safe area, CoreText
  measurement, one-axis scroll, PNG / JPEG / WebP from a bundled file or
  `http(s)`, and a single-line field (`value`, `onChange`, `placeholder`,
  `disabled`, `secureTextEntry`, `keyboardType`). Refresh, zoom, paging,
  disk cache, SVG, GIF frames, multiline input and composition events are
  not mounted. `synth.rs` is the one-finger touch and the software keyboard
  from `crates/nsh-platform-ios/src/synth.rs` (no drag path, no hardware
  modifiers, no screenshot). The runner binary is `nlayer-ios-app`.
